{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "id": "omarchy-essentials",
  "title": "Learn Omarchy",
  "description": "Choose a short, hands-on module. Learn the shortcuts and surfaces that make Omarchy fast.",
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "omarchy-tour",
      "title": "Omarchy tour",
      "description": "Let HEXON introduce the menu bar, then open the Omarchy menu with your first hotkey.",
      "icon": "01",
      "estimatedMinutes": 2,
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "tour-welcome",
          "kind": "tour",
          "pose": "talk",
          "instruction": "Hi there! I'm HEXON. Welcome to Omarchy! Let's take a quick tour of your new desktop.",
          "detail": "HEXON is giving the tour. Press Enter to continue early, or Skip to jump ahead.",
          "keys": [],
          "audio": "audio/tour-welcome.mp3",
          "completion": {
            "type": "narration-complete",
            "delayMs": 700,
            "durationMs": 4000
          },
          "highlight": {
            "shape": "circle",
            "anchor": "center",
            "x": 0,
            "y": -60,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 12,
            "borderWidth": 2,
            "radius": 6,
            "durationMs": 1000
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "tour-workspaces",
          "kind": "tour",
          "instruction": "See those numbers up in the top left? Those are your workspaces. Each one is its own desktop, and the highlighted one is where you are right now.",
          "detail": "HEXON is giving the tour. Press Enter to continue early, or Skip to jump ahead.",
          "keys": [],
          "audio": "audio/tour-workspaces.mp3",
          "completion": {
            "type": "narration-complete",
            "delayMs": 900,
            "durationMs": 6000
          },
          "highlight": {
            "shape": "rectangle",
            "anchor": "top-left",
            "x": 8,
            "y": 1,
            "width": 180,
            "height": 27,
            "borderWidth": 3,
            "radius": 8,
            "dynamic": "workspaces",
            "durationMs": 1200
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "tour-clock",
          "kind": "tour",
          "instruction": "Front and center, you've got the date and time. Click there later and it turns into your calendar.",
          "detail": "HEXON is giving the tour. Press Enter to continue early, or Skip to jump ahead.",
          "keys": [],
          "audio": "audio/tour-clock.mp3",
          "completion": {
            "type": "narration-complete",
            "delayMs": 900,
            "durationMs": 5000
          },
          "highlight": {
            "shape": "rectangle",
            "anchor": "top",
            "x": 0,
            "y": 1,
            "width": 230,
            "height": 27,
            "borderWidth": 3,
            "radius": 8,
            "durationMs": 1200
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "tour-status",
          "kind": "tour",
          "instruction": "Over on the right is your status crew: network, Bluetooth, audio, display, and battery. Click any of them and it opens its own panel.",
          "detail": "HEXON is giving the tour. Press Enter to continue early, or Skip to jump ahead.",
          "keys": [],
          "audio": "audio/tour-status.mp3",
          "completion": {
            "type": "narration-complete",
            "delayMs": 900,
            "durationMs": 6000
          },
          "highlight": {
            "shape": "rectangle",
            "anchor": "top-right",
            "x": -14,
            "y": 1,
            "width": 350,
            "height": 27,
            "borderWidth": 3,
            "radius": 8,
            "durationMs": 1200
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "tour-omarchy-menu",
          "instruction": "Ready for your first hotkey? Press Super and Space together, and the Omarchy menu opens.",
          "detail": "This menu is home base. Pick an app, change a setting, or reach anything else in Omarchy from here.",
          "keys": [
            "SUPER",
            "+",
            "SPACE"
          ],
          "audio": "audio/tour-omarchy-menu.mp3",
          "help": {
            "label": "Open it for me",
            "command": [
              "omarchy",
              "menu",
              "summon",
              "root"
            ]
          },
          "cleanup": [
            "omarchy",
            "menu",
            "close"
          ],
          "completion": {
            "type": "hyprland-layer-open",
            "namespace": "omarchy-menu"
          },
          "highlight": {
            "shape": "rectangle",
            "anchor": "center",
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 620,
            "height": 760,
            "borderWidth": 10,
            "radius": 12,
            "durationMs": 2200
          },
          "completionMessage": "And that's the Omarchy menu. Type a few letters or use the arrow keys, then press Enter to launch whatever you picked.",
          "completionAudio": "audio/tour-omarchy-menu-done.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "menus-and-apps",
      "title": "Menus and apps",
      "description": "Find commands, installed apps, and the built-in shortcut guide.",
      "icon": "02",
      "estimatedMinutes": 3,
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "open-root-menu",
          "instruction": "Let's start with the big one. Press Super and Space to open the Omarchy menu.",
          "detail": "Everything in Omarchy is reachable from this menu, so it's worth making this shortcut muscle memory.",
          "keys": [
            "SUPER",
            "+",
            "SPACE"
          ],
          "audio": "audio/open-root-menu.mp3",
          "help": {
            "label": "Open the menu for me",
            "command": [
              "omarchy",
              "menu",
              "summon",
              "root"
            ]
          },
          "cleanup": [
            "omarchy",
            "menu",
            "close"
          ],
          "completion": {
            "type": "hyprland-layer-open",
            "namespace": "omarchy-menu"
          },
          "highlight": {
            "shape": "rectangle",
